---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import SectionTitle from './SectionTitle.astro';
---

<Section id="about">
  <SectionTitle>About me</SectionTitle>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>
        At <strong>Posit</strong>, I lead development of a new Jupyter notebook experience in Positron—a next-generation data science IDE. My career spans multiple disciplines—from being a journalist at the <strong>New York Times</strong> to a data scientist at <strong>Johns Hopkins Data Science Lab</strong> and even a “data artist in residence” at a geospatial visualization startup.
      </p>
      <p>
        My <strong>Ph.D. from Vanderbilt University</strong> focused on statistical methodologies for network data, deep learning, and data visualization. At the <strong>University of Vermont</strong>, I studied statistics, mathematics, and computer science.
      </p>
    </div>
    <aside class="about-note">
      <p>When I am not in “work mode,” I enjoy photographing birds and my daughter, running and hiking, reading science fiction, and contributing to open-source projects.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 3rem; }
  .about-copy { max-width: 65ch; }
  .about-copy p + p { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .about-note { border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-left: 1.5rem; font-family: 'Bitter', Georgia, serif; font-size: var(--text-small); font-style: italic; color: var(--muted-foreground); }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .about-note { border-left: 0; padding-left: 0; }
  }
</style>
